</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I rose with Him from out the grave—</l><l>And how shall I who died to sin</l><l>Continue still to live therein,</l><l>The victor living as the slave?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>At God’s right hand He took His place,</l><l>And while for saints my Savior pleads,</l><l>My heart for sinners intercedes</l><l>That they might know His saving grace.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Oh, what a name to me is given—</l><l>A son of God, by second birth!</l><l>I represent Him on the earth,</l><l>He represents me now in heaven.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>As Jesus dwells beyond the skies,</l><l>I dwell within this world of strife;</l><l>And as He lives within my life,</l><l>In Him I’m in the heavenlies!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
